ack burner pet project that  was the galaxy note edge and now every  phone like this has this crazy edge  display and i'm glad they keep doing  that stuff and you got to give samsung  credit for making a phone that can stand  out for how good it looks in an era well  this little mini era where so many  phones are accused of all looking the  same this one actually does stand out in  a pretty awesome way and i like that a  lot about it there may be little things  you don't like about it little  unmappable buttons little software  quirks here and there maybe the speaker  is not the best but as a complete  package this is an awesome phone i  recommend it i've said the word awesome  so many times you probably can  understand that i like this already  and i'd recommend it i'll have links  below for other stuff you want to check  out but that's pretty much it thank you  for watching talk to you guys in the  next one  peace  [Music]

